     "page": 59,
     "text": "GPU Memory Hierarchy\n\nDDR, GDDR, and HBM Optimize Different Constraints\n\n\n\n\n\n▪ DDR favors capacity, expandability, and cost per GB. GDDR balances pin\n  bandwidth and board cost.\n▪ HBM favors bandwidth per package and per watt. The choice depends on the\n  workload and system constraints.\n\nMemory Wall     CPU Memory    GPU Memory    SOTA Memory     Advanced AI Computing and Systems        59",
